        {
          "trait": "Rubber immunity, blunt resistance, poison immunity, and sharp or water weaknesses",
          "reason": "The compact IR has no defensive resistance, immunity, conditional weakness, or submersion mechanics."
        },
        {
          "trait": "Gear 2 strain and Gear 3's post-use shrinkage",
          "reason": "Resources, states, temporary drawbacks, and recovery rules are unavailable."
        },
        {
          "trait": "Observation Haki and Future Sight",
          "reason": "Although reveal is representable, the source does not specify precise reliability or timing, and no separate executable mechanic was needed for the selected specializations."
        },
        {
          "trait": "Conqueror's Haki knockout",
          "reason": "The source condition targets weak-willed beings, but the prototype has no tag filters or target-strength conditions."
